<h2>Campaign setup</h2>
<p>The account used Local Services Ads and call tracking. A booked job was the primary conversion. A call was an earlier step, so call volume alone did not show whether the ads were filling the schedule.</p>
<h2>What the result shows</h2>
<p>More jobs were booked while advertising cost per booking fell. Cost per click is an account-level supporting metric. Local Services Ads charge per lead.</p>
